    "MassingTierDecision": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "massing.tiers 的一段：从底到顶逐段的收放比例（塔形/退台的立面轮廓表态）。\n\n比例相对 massing 的对应向尺寸（width_ratio ↔ width，depth_ratio ↔ depth），\n段与段在立面上居中堆叠。这是**可选**表态——缺省时图纸与编译器从\nvolumes 落层或 shape 派生轮廓，与本字段无关。",
      "properties": {
        "floors": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "width_ratio": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "type": "number"
        },
        "depth_ratio": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "floors",
        "width_ratio"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "MaterialIntent": {
